          "type": "FDynamicMesh3*"
        },
        {
          "name": "Duplicate",
          "type": "Bool"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "Void",
      "docs": "Filter the triangles in a FMeshRenderBufferSet into the SecondaryIndexBuffer.\nRequires that RenderBuffers->Triangles has been initialized.\n@param bDuplicate if set, then primary IndexBuffer is unmodified and SecondaryIndexBuffer contains duplicates. Otherwise triangles are sorted via predicate into either primary or secondary."
    },
    {
